  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Project VD",
  "excerpt": "This project aims to formalize [value distribution theory](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Value_distribution_theory_of_holomorphic_functions) for meromorphic functions in the complex plane, roughly following Serge Lang's [Introduction to Complex Hyperbolic Spaces](https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4757-1945-1). The project uses the [Lean](https://lean-lang.org/) theorem prover and builds on [mathlib](https://leanprover-community.github.io/), the Lean mathematical library."
 },
